  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Abfd 100) #5720, eff 1-1-94, EXPIRED: 1-1-00 New. #7211, INTERIM, eff 3-1-00, EXPIRES: 6-29-00 New. #7367, eff 9-27-00; ss by #7473, eff 4-5-01",
